OL,3,GNEWSAWhen will Preston's red telephone
OL,4,Aboxes return?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lancashire city's famous row of red
OL,7,Ftelephone boxes have undergone a
OL,8,F#75,000 refurbishment, but are not set
OL,9,Fto return to their home in Preston city
OL,10,Fcentre any time soon.
OL,12,FThe nine telephone booths on Market
OL,13,FStreet were due to return by the end of
OL,14,Fthe year, but works are being carried
OL,15,Fout at the former Post Office property
OL,16,Fdirectly behind the kiosks.
OL,18,FWith scaffolding being put up around
OL,19,Fthe full building perimeter, the
OL,20,Fcouncil said the phone boxes will have
OL,21,Fto wait to return until the building
OL,22,Fworks have been completed.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
